+
+**Before HUMBLE**, a newcomer following the docs got stuck at `make start_dev_db` (README.md:31).
+
+## Verified setup
+
+```bash
+pip3 install virtualenv
+virtualenv venv
+source venv/bin/activate
+make recreate_db
+```
+
